window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>One smile. One moment. One touch. One journey.</b></p> <p>Rider Cruz is the secretary of the Dark Horse MC. Kyle Stewart is new in Pineville. She's trying to hide in plain sight. She's not looking for another failed relationship. He isn't looking for a relationship at all. She is clearly too good for him.</p> <p>Her past will catch up with her. He will be the man who has her back. They were never meant for more. And yet, more is all they crave.</p>"; 
